-- 043: challenge descriptions become markdown (Session 56).
--
-- Until now functions/api/challenges.js stored a server-sanitized HTML subset:
-- only <a href> survived, newlines became <br>, everything else was entity-escaped.
-- Every user-written field is markdown now, rendered (and sanitized) by
-- js/markdown.js, so these rows are converted: <a href="X">T</a> -> [T](X),
-- <br> -> newline, entities unescaped. Generated from production on 2026-10-10.
-- Each UPDATE matches the exact old text, so re-running it, or running it after
-- a row has changed, is a no-op.

